  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「思った以上に、ゴタゴタしてるみたいだね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「『帰宅部争奪戦』って、ほんとに『戦』って感じだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「『生徒会長再任選挙』のときは、そういう意味では気楽だったかもね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「けっきょく生徒会長さんが続投して、こっちの生活としては何も変わらなかったわけだし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「誰が勝とうと、あんまり関係なかった気もするし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「今回は、他人事じゃないもんね。すべての帰宅部の人間にとって、無視できない騒ぎだもん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「とくに、転校生くんにはね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「自分の行動で、選択で、君咲学院の今後が変わっちゃう。これって、とっても怖いことだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「生徒会長さんは、いつもこんな『恐ろしい流れ』に押しつぶされないように踏ん張ってたのかな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「すごいなぁ。真似できないっていうか、尊敬しちゃうよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「もちろん……わたしなんか、たくさんいる帰宅部のひとりだから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「気楽な立場ではあるんだけど。それでもけっこう、どきどきしちゃうよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「転校生くんなんか、もっとゴタゴタの中心にいるんだからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「気が重いかもしれないけど、困ったことがあったら相談してね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「『わたしたち』は、転校生くんの味方だから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「生徒会長さんにも、頼りにくいだろうし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「あのひとにも文芸部の部長っていう立場があるから、迂闊に動けないみたいだからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ほんとに自力で何とかするしかないよね、帰宅部のみんなで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「転校生くんが、自分の意志で、いろいろ決定して行動しないとね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「憂鬱になっちゃうよね。何で先生たちは、こんな揉めごとの原因になりそうな決定をしたのかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「バスケ部ではおかしなイタズラ？　があったみたいだし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ちょっと、不穏な動きをしてるひともいるっぽいよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「嫌だなぁ、何事もなく平穏に終わればいいんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
